<title>USA: GOLF-SCORES FROM FIRST ROUND OF TOUR CHAMPIONSHIP.</title>
<headline>GOLF-SCORES FROM FIRST ROUND OF TOUR CHAMPIONSHIP.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Oklahoma 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>First-round scores from</p>
<p>the $3 million Tour Championship on Thursday at Southern Hills</p>
<p>Country Club (players U.S. unless noted):</p>
<p>66 Vijay Singh (Fiji), Tom Lehman</p>
<p>67 Steve Jones, Phil Mickelson</p>
<p>68 Brad Faxon, Fred Couples</p>
<p>69 Mark Calcavecchia</p>
<p>70 Tom Watson, Tiger Woods, John Cook, Steve Stricker</p>
<p>71 Jeff Sluman, Fred Funk, Corey Pavin, David Duval, Michael</p>
<p>Bradley</p>
<p>72 Jim Furyk, Davis Love</p>
<p>73 Kenny Perry, Tommy Tolles, Justin Leonard, Greg Norman</p>
<p>(Australia), Scott Hoch, Mark Brooks</p>
<p>74 Duffy Waldorf, Mark O'Meara</p>
<p>75 Nick Faldo (Britain)</p>
<p>76 Ernie Els (South Africa)</p>
<p>78 Jeff Maggert</p>
